                <p>Each named pilot has a handicap based on their Gunnery and Piloting/Anti-Mech skill levels. The player with the lower average handicap earns a BSP bonus equal to the handicap difference × 10. Unnamed pilots in a unit of 500 BV or more count toward the average handicap as if they were 0 handicap.</p>
