                <p>Tracks are the individual battles within a contract. The primary player rolls to determine which track is played each month. All tracks end when one side has no units in play, or at the turn limit.</p>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li><strong>Straight Fight</strong> — Destroy &gt;50% of the opponent's force. Classic engagement.</li>
